<mxCell id="c45" value="Interaction is ManyToOne to Customer (optional = false, join column customer_id). The service resolves the customer first, links it, then saves the interaction in one unit of work.&#10;No interaction read endpoints exist; customer delete has no cascade, so a customer with interactions cannot be removed cleanly (FK constraint)." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica Neue;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1A1B1C;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
